 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Let's Go to Your House, Oppa"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "오빠 집으로 가자"
   },
   {
    "en": "Let's Go to Oppa's House"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Florence Café’s owner, Yoo Ji-an, has someone who feels more like an older brother than her real one.\n\nThat person is Choi Jae-geon, the heir of Hwaseong Construction, who never misses a chance to get on Ji-an’s nerves.\n\nOne day, after an unexpected incident leaves Ji-an with nowhere to go, Jae-geon is the one to reach out first.\n\n“Come to my place.”\n\nAnd so begins their cohabitation.\n\nThey’ve always bickered and clashed at every turn, but suddenly, the atmosphere between them starts to shift.\n\nThen, with just one sentence from Jae-geon—\n\n“Come to my room.”\n\nJi-an’s heart starts to race.\n\nKIM's hit novel, Come to My Place, now adapted into a webtoon!\nFamiliar yet unfamiliar, in a home that isn’t her own—\nA fiery love-hate romance begins!"
  },
